 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "In 1870,",
   "s": 0.0,
   "e": 1.204
  },
  {
   "text": "Paris was surrounded,",
   "s": 1.418,
   "e": 2.658
  },
  {
   "text": "and the only way out was up.",
   "s": 2.873,
   "e": 4.64
  },
  {
   "text": "Enemy armies had closed every road,",
   "s": 5.152,
   "e": 7.423
  },
  {
   "text": "rail line, and telegraph wire.",
   "s": 7.571,
   "e": 9.362
  },
  {
   "text": "So Parisians filled giant balloons with gas and sent their mail into the sky.",
   "s": 9.857,
   "e": 14.498
  },
  {
   "text": "Dozens of balloons lifted off,",
   "s": 15.012,
   "e": 16.892
  },
  {
   "text": "often at night,",
   "s": 16.997,
   "e": 17.733
  },
  {
   "text": "drifting over enemy lines.",
   "s": 17.999,
   "e": 19.648
  },
  {
   "text": "Some carried passengers.",
   "s": 20.062,
   "e": 21.411
  },
  {
   "text": "Some carried millions of letters.",
   "s": 21.723,
   "e": 23.753
  },
  {
   "text": "Even a government minister escaped that way,",
   "s": 24.171,
   "e": 26.26
  },
  {
   "text": "to raise a new army.",
   "s": 26.427,
   "e": 27.507
  },
  {
   "text": "But the balloons couldn't fly back.",
   "s": 28.082,
   "e": 29.983
  },
  {
   "text": "They went wherever the wind took them.",
   "s": 30.286,
   "e": 31.856
  },
  {
   "text": "So how did Paris get replies?",
   "s": 32.384,
   "e": 34.281
  },
  {
   "text": "Pigeons.",
   "s": 34.884,
   "e": 35.447
  },
  {
   "text": "Each balloon carried birds out of the city.",
   "s": 35.908,
   "e": 38.173
  },
  {
   "text": "Then, once free,",
   "s": 38.547,
   "e": 39.66
  },
  {
   "text": "the pigeons flew home with messages.",
   "s": 39.896,
   "e": 41.794
  },
  {
   "text": "Photographers shrank those messages onto tiny film,",
   "s": 42.241,
   "e": 45.188
  },
  {
   "text": "so one pigeon could carry thousands.",
   "s": 45.439,
   "e": 47.544
  },
  {
   "text": "Enemy soldiers tried to shoot the balloons down,",
   "s": 48.01,
   "e": 50.421
  },
  {
   "text": "but many still got through.",
   "s": 50.615,
   "e": 52.131
  },
  {
   "text": "A city with every road closed still found the sky.",
   "s": 52.591,
   "e": 56.088
  }
 ]
